        "original_id": "153950e2-dca8-552f-8ec9-12e911831a58",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Winnie the Pooh (2011 film), Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book\n- Companies: Walt Disney Animation Studios, Walt Disney Pictures\n- People: Stephen Sommers, Edward S. Feldman, Raju Patel, Ronald Yanover, Mark Geldman, Travis Oates, Jim Cummings\n- Topics: film production, voice acting\n\nFacts:\n- Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book is a 1994 live-action American adventure film.\n- Stephen Sommers co-wrote and directed Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book.\n- Edward S. Feldman and Raju Patel produced Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book.\n- Ronald Yanover and Mark Geldman provided the story for Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book.\n- Winnie the Pooh is a 2011 American animated buddy musical comedy film.\n- Walt Disney Animation Studios produced Winnie the Pooh, and Walt Disney Pictures released it.\n- Travis Oates and Jim Cummings were the only two original voice actors to return for the 2011 Winnie the Pooh movie.",
